      "note": "level 2 demo (Corvane demo 2d-affine): a rotated affine BG captured and compared with the GBATEK mapping (picture generated at run time); values[4..6] samples / wrong / capture finished. Result block as Corvane's demos (values from words[3:], 13 words are enough); no save chip, no NitroFS"
    },
    "l2-2d-mosaic": {
      "rom": "lightenette-l2-2d-mosaic.nds",
      "item_id": 1186310803,
      "item_id_text": "l2-2d-mosaic",
