      "note": "level 2 demo (Corvane demo 2d-mosaic): a 4x4 BG mosaic captured and compared pixel by pixel; values[4..6] samples / wrong / capture finished. Result block as Corvane's demos (values from words[3:], 13 words are enough); no save chip, no NitroFS"
    },
    "l2-2d-obj-bitmap": {
      "rom": "lightenette-l2-2d-obj-bitmap.nds",
      "item_id": 590847140,
      "item_id_text": "l2-2d-obj-bitmap",
      "frames": 120,
      "note": "level 2 demo (Corvane demo 2d-obj-bitmap): a 16bpp bitmap OBJ captured and compared texel by texel (picture generated at run time); values[4..6] samples / wrong / capture finished. Result block as Corvane's demos (values from words[3:], 13 words are enough); no save chip, no NitroFS"
    },
    "l2-snd-capture": {
      "rom": "lightenette-l2-snd-capture.nds",
      "item_id": 1426653278,
      "item_id_text": "l2-snd-capture",
      "frames": 120,
      "note": "level 2 demo (Corvane demo snd-capture): the two sound capture units record the mixer output of the song; values[4] capture unit busy bits, values[5] peak of the rings. Result block as Corvane's demos (values from words[3:], 13 words are enough); no save chip, no NitroFS"
    }
